title: "NeuroEpigenomics_AD: Epigenomic dynamics during Alzheimer's disease progression"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline to analyze snATAC-seq data from the SEA-AD atlas and track
  chromatin accessibility changes associated with the reactivation of
  transposable elements across Alzheimer's disease progression.
